W:
W: Well, they gave him his orders down in Monroe, Virginia
W:Saying Steve you are way behind time
W:This is not thirty eight, but it’s old ninety seven
W:You must put her into Spencer on time
W:
W: He turned and said to his black greasy fireman
W:Shovel on a little more coal
W:And when we cross the White Oak Mountain
W:You can watch old Ninety-Seven roll
W:
W: It’s a mighty rough road from Lynchburg to Danville
W:And lying on a three mile grade
W:It was on this grade that he lost his average
W:You can see what a jump he made
W:
W: He was going down the grade making ninety miles an hour
W:When his whistle broke into a scream
W:They found him in the wreck with his hand on the throttle
W:He was scalded to death by the steam
W:
W: Now all you ladies must heed this warning
W:From this time now on learn
W:Never speak harsh words to your true loving husband
W:He may leave you and never return